# KAKILIMA TOPUP Frontend

Next.js 15 (App Router) storefront for Indonesian game top-up. Package/brand: **KAKILIMA TOPUP**. Backend is a separate Laravel API (`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`); this repo is frontend only.

## Stack
- React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4
- NextAuth (Credentials) + Sanctum Bearer token in JWT session
- Axios via `src/lib/client.ts` (`httpClient` / `createAxiosInstance`)
- TanStack Query for fetching; Redux Toolkit present but prefer Query for server data
- Formik + Yup for forms; Framer Motion / Swiper for UI

## Brand & copy
- Site name from `SITE_NAME` in `src/lib/site-config.ts` (default `KAKILIMA TOPUP`)
- User-facing UI language: **Bahasa Indonesia**
- Do not reintroduce "WXSTORE" as display brand text

## Scope
- Guest checkout is allowed; auth required only for `/account/*`, `/dashboard/*`
- Do not add admin panel UI unless explicitly requested
- Prefer editing existing patterns over new abstractions

## Key paths
- Pages: `src/app/`
- UI: `src/components/`
- API wrappers: `src/services/`
- Auth/client: `src/lib/auth.ts`, `src/lib/client.ts`
